# T4: TIMED B = c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-traffic-roundhost of the paired ABAB at 8 live users (A B A B; T1..T4 eight live, T5..T8 four live). Audits off in both arms (the traffic profile's); the arms differ in the round-host flags alone. Each job follows its own all-four reset in this one image.
# Tests: warmup, coding, concurrent8_steady, concurrent8_code_32k, concurrent8_code_128k. CI IS PAUSED for the whole timing block: the ARC runner scale sets are at zero (the owner scales them; the hardware host runner that runs these jobs is NOT scaled down), no build, no CI push and no other job beside a timing job.
# READ with scripts/ci/w2ln_timing_compare.py pair <A server log> <B server log> --live 8 --window <steady|32k|128k> --max-load <the E1 number> --a-load <A load.log> --b-load <B load.log> (rounds paired by mean-context bucket, 100 matched rounds a window else VOID,
# the load median and the pair's load gap applied), the A-to-A drift floor from T1 and T3 (`floor`), the texts by the smoke JSON hashes, and the PHASE attribution with scripts/ci/round_host_report.py pair <A server log> <B server log> --live 8 (the host time of every phase of the step,
# B minus A; a phase that fell and a round that did not was hidden under a device trace). PRE-REGISTERED, per length and live count: the paired mean round delta of B must be negative in BOTH pairs and its pooled median above the A-to-A floor
# (estimate -4.5 ms at eight live); a pair positive by more than the floor, a text difference or a stall is a NO-GO. Duration (estimate): 90 min. Soft.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/round-host window (docs/tp4-round-host.md; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/round-host and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards
# are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the order, the classes, the minutes, the NEEDS graph and every read rule.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-rh-1 is what B0 builds from the pushed tp4/round-host commit; every later job serves that one image. A commit of a file the image
# carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-rh-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-traffic-roundhost
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent8_steady,concurrent8_code_32k,concurrent8_code_128k
